{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_07_title", "source_sha256": "777566cabaebb481958e802b83995cdc4b8f128b294a2f996dc7a71af7bc0226", "ja": "星に願いを", "zh": "向星星许愿", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_07_synopsis", "source_sha256": "9ab7a80bd0831c8a48d4b0f9e42fe7572bfe90ff9ebb55cb4d32cebb9ddf06ef", "ja": "無事に公演を終えたミルキーウェイ。ライブ\n後の打ち上げで、美希はスパイの件をプロデ\nューサーに謝る。ひとりじゃなくて、みんな\nで頑張ろうと言うプロデューサーに、美希は\n笑顔で頷くのだった。", "zh": "『Milky Way』的公演平安落幕。\n在演唱会后的庆功宴上，\n美希为了当间谍一事向制作人道歉。\n制作人要求她别再独自行动，和大家一起努力，\n美希笑着点头答应了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_07_1000_p", "source_sha256": "5dd95c4c3b85fb54dd21b0652e6adf0d900584b83722bffccc3778f0ae257e2f", "ja": "（ミルキーウェイ、初公演の幕が下りた。\n色々あったけど……最高のステージだったな！）", "zh": "（『Milky Way』的首次公演落幕了。\n虽然发生了很多插曲……但依旧是场优秀的表演！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_07_1001_027say", "source_sha256": "55618428bd456fb0c2d7bb8d9ed5c0ffe686aaed7e55b489e2ee345e0dd8ba5b", "ja": "{$P$}、見ててくれましたか！？\n私達のステージ！", "zh": "{$P$}，你有看到吗！？\n我们的表演！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_07_1002_p", "source_sha256": "622ffa5ccf815b95433537abe8d97d9ba852eedda3fa99a82f6931960f0e1ec3", "ja": "ああ、ちゃんと見てたよ。掛け値なしに最高だった。\nみんな、お疲れさま！", "zh": "有啊，看得一清二楚。说是最棒的表演也不为过。\n辛苦你们了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_07_1003_047sub", "source_sha256": "e2df0f7f225366a917b6b6d60718d490b8cdf91e6f11287443471a1becf5859f", "ja": "へへっ、やった～！\nオレ、めちゃくちゃ楽しかったよ！", "zh": "嘿嘿！太好了～！\n我在台上非常开心喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_07_1004_047sub", "source_sha256": "846302035aa57d19cdf772c97484099d7379c3600dc86b9a040fb867dda416e9", "ja": "すっげー緊張してたんだけどさ、\nひとりじゃないから、勇気が出せたんだ！", "zh": "其实我本来超紧张的，\n但我知道自己不是一个人，就鼓起勇气了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_07_1005_027say", "source_sha256": "4c509f42d71d6a4bf2fcf2e8904c4a88c3680931a3bc36bfe082fbaae33458a2", "ja": "うん、私もだよっ！　コンサートライトが、\nまるで星空みたいにきらめいてて……", "zh": "嗯，我也是！\n萤光棒看起来就跟星空一样闪耀……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_07_1006_027say", "source_sha256": "12219469a4a6f7f53e010a68cd235e6bf512466535882287593f71d7cab9ad2c", "ja": "あの輝きの1つ1つが、私達を応援してくれる、\nファンの気持ちなんだって……そう思えたから！", "zh": "就好像……那每一道光辉都是\n粉丝们为我们声援的心意！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_07_1007_031tom", "source_sha256": "c00c08956b491362da224da784c957d5a0d08d6c443aa38176c5caaf8589d805", "ja": "そうですね～、子豚ちゃん達の楽しげな鳴き声が、\nずっと聞こえていましたよ～♪", "zh": "是啊～我一直都能听到\n小猪们愉悦的叫声～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_07_1008_031tom", "source_sha256": "0e5fc8b73b230f6bf56c0f6ea928c2eded231a48280bb89ad7d6bc4cbb6fab5d", "ja": "公演の最初から最後まで、\n聖母の愛をたっぷり届けられました～♪", "zh": "这一整场公演从头到尾\n都满满传播了圣母的爱喔～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_07_1009_038chz", "source_sha256": "fde806159b12540b9f03ff8cb72694e201776bd9176ea323b8639a2ab2129b3c", "ja": "ふふっ、わたくし達5人の手にかかれば、\n当然の結果……朝ごはん前ですわ！", "zh": "呵呵，我们五个人出马，\n这是当然的结果……小事一桩！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_07_1010_038chz", "source_sha256": "6288b3df966ee15fb9d5191d34fa7d62e7ce910953f4dbaba3749d777d161847", "ja": "このまま世界一のユニットを目指しましょう！\nおーっほっほっほっ、ゲホッ、ゴホッ！？", "zh": "就这样以世界第一的团体为目标吧！\n哦～呵呵呵、咳咳、咳咳！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_07_1011_p", "source_sha256": "b4aaa9e481e3c0e5dc779397d621303bdfa2bbeec4915b05a5d990f915adf51c", "ja": "（みんな、いい笑顔だ。みんなも手応えを感じている\nみたいだな……本当に、いいユニットになった）", "zh": "（大家都展露灿烂的笑容。\n看来她们也都很有成就感……真的是个很棒的团体。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_07_1012_003mik", "source_sha256": "37067a0a723227ce2419554a6865e84d70efad5dfcbbdbdedcfc3991a44f1590", "ja": "{$P$}、ちょっといーい？", "zh": "{$P$}，可以过来一下吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_07_1013_p", "source_sha256": "000eb4846ab0447c376c9c080fd20e0377e3eb639d9b447c0fb6dce042542d28", "ja": "美希？　どうした？", "zh": "美希，怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_07_1014_003mik", "source_sha256": "9dc1595a8deb21b503af4bd23d88d4c3a1fdfd5f31313f10b779b1503fc1039e", "ja": "んーとね……\nミキ、言っておきたいことがあるの。", "zh": "其实啊……\n美希有些话想跟你说唷。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_07_1015_003mik", "source_sha256": "3d6e1eaf0d6175ad4183ae3c99100e03862d4764def5bc56e7f6c2db2d65230a", "ja": "{$P$}、まだ怒ってる？\nミキが勝手に、黒井社長に会ったこと。", "zh": "{$P$}，你还在生气吗？\n气美希擅自跑去找黑井社长。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_07_1016_003mik", "source_sha256": "308fc032d4041398ab121c0b94d979fcf4f356dc6ab8fa2a4cecffec42c46601", "ja": "スパイなんてしちゃダメ！　って、言われてたのに、\nミキ、しちゃったから。", "zh": "你明明要美希不可以去当间谍的，\n但美希还是跑去了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_07_1017_p", "source_sha256": "1d3b675bc29268fe39d64c1bd7c9ff3fe7a50ff9f78c5be7f2e9bde30d06725e", "ja": "……ああ。もちろん、怒ってる。\n本当に心配したんだぞ？　俺も、みんなも。", "zh": "……是啊，我当然还很生气。\n我真的很担心喔，不只我，大家也是。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_07_1018_003mik", "source_sha256": "6d61ae144af2e7fec460b2fdf4e2f24c3fbb6570ff34e2963e75bfa1a1b1f29f", "ja": "うん、ごめんね。", "zh": "嗯，对不起。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_07_1019_p", "source_sha256": "0c83871a32760049bb640c5fcfffb8bff9632d169b73d896e8d5ae07673c2367", "ja": "いや。俺が一番怒ってるのは、美希が\n一人で全部背負い込んだことだよ。", "zh": "不，我最生气的，\n是美希你把事情全揽在自己一个人身上。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_07_1020_003mik", "source_sha256": "ff6d7e44be9bf6e6fd3dbaa933c0f5ca349922c0835ebf07d3fd9b253e2ebe42", "ja": "ミキ、みんなのためになるかなって思ったの。\nでも、{$P$}はイヤだった？", "zh": "美希想说可以帮上大家的忙。\n可是，{$P$}不喜欢这样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_07_1021_p", "source_sha256": "eab80083198ce17e0303283fb463b8c1dac0abd1006c71dda098d7b860aca970", "ja": "そうじゃない。美希がみんなのためって思ったように、\nみんなも美希のことを大事にしたいんだ。", "zh": "不是的。美希，你替大家着想很好，\n但同样的，大家也都很重视你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_07_1022_p", "source_sha256": "c5dd5d20bb3742d8e86c55d65e3bb5437bfcc2212999a35d1dd5099881dc0b62", "ja": "美希だけに、重荷を背負って欲しくないんだ。", "zh": "大家都不希望美希你独自承担。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_07_1023_003mik", "source_sha256": "20f6a6f72f0882777920ec2f655b9c78b303ad7cc58aaac21af9243ed0d2aa09", "ja": "ふ～ん……そうなんだ？　ミキができることは、\nミキがすればいいって思うけど……。", "zh": "是喔～原来是这样吗？\n美希是觉得，自己办得到的事就自己来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_07_1024_003mik", "source_sha256": "2a39acf24b99898f13316d3a02e47ec2f8a08c5ae96eb82eda393007c1f7ad92", "ja": "あ。もしかして、\nみんなで頑張ったほうがいいってこと？", "zh": "啊，该不会，\n你觉得大家一起努力会比较好？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_07_1025_p", "source_sha256": "2b2947ac8d3e8668c07cb59c23d2475bc35899101a1e59553b16bc55367067bc", "ja": "そう、ミルキーウェイはみんなのユニットだから。\n……そっちの方が、楽しいと思わないか？", "zh": "没错，因为『Milky Way』是大家共组的团体。\n……一起努力也会比较开心，不是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_07_1026_003mik", "source_sha256": "7a1ec7cb3773fc81de44853fba021078ae60b1684a37baba3f5255d98b74d4ae", "ja": "うん！　昴くんがいて、紗代子がいて、\n千鶴がいて、朋花がいて……", "zh": "嗯！因为有阿昴、纱代子、\n千鹤、朋花……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_07_1027_003mik", "source_sha256": "d7607efea6e1236f9c0e179e9c6482ea217b8d2da5d62581e675e48777ffd64a", "ja": "{$P$}もいる！\n一人で頑張るより、そっちの方が楽しいって思うな☆", "zh": "还有{$P$}！与其一个人努力，\n大家一起努力更开心，美希这样觉得呢☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_07_1028_p", "source_sha256": "66a4cd630b7ee5ddbcc385a2b3a9b9c0ac25a0a38b38a97d43312282cad3cc94", "ja": "なら、これからは一人で無茶はしないでくれ。\n約束してくれるか？", "zh": "好，那你以后不能再一个人乱来了。\n可以跟我一言为定吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_07_1029_003mik", "source_sha256": "e3078d17381eb82b09d0ea1c71dcf2bc1a08fa6acf440acdae173361383621d5", "ja": "わかったの♪　約束ね。\nあ、でも、みんなで頑張るのはいいけど……", "zh": "知道了♪一言为定。\n啊，不过，大家一起努力是很好没错……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_07_1030_003mik", "source_sha256": "60e31bd652dee658f69766fe206ffa9dcaad00d551b3aa68d5f5e1928fff2a7e", "ja": "{$P$}の\n一番そばにいるのは、ミキだけがいいって思うな♪", "zh": "但是跟{$P$}最亲近的，\n美希觉得只能是美希呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_07_1031_p", "source_sha256": "3c15ac665bb43aa6632e165275731cabbf8344ac60cb55b719f6e107d6b3f9d8", "ja": "う、うん？", "zh": "什、什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_07_1032_003mik", "source_sha256": "d91e88ec063ebb4b3dc266dfa5cc976c76f37db50a379de293703b9afee9b930", "ja": "だって、ミキのこと大事にしてくれるんだよね？\nならミキをずーっと見てて。約束のお返しね、あはっ☆", "zh": "因为，你不是很重视美希吗？所以要永远看着美希唷。\n你也要跟美希一言为定唷，啊哈☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_07_1033_p", "source_sha256": "983d8670231ef56bf1b8c18a3d515a95e322622f9aec8ff9d07d0dea27716181", "ja": "（強引に約束を取り付けられてしまった……\n言われなくても、目を逸らせそうにない）", "zh": "（我被强迫签约了……\n不过就算她没要求，我也会目不转睛地看着的。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_07_1034_p", "source_sha256": "804a2fef74aca9075420081076846bab0b66356ff620ca5d42844eaa67bc947a", "ja": "（美希だけじゃなくて、ミルキーウェイの輝きから。\nそのうち誰もが、目を逸らせなくなるだろう！）", "zh": "（不只是看着美希，而是看着『Milky Way』的光芒。\n在不久的将来，任谁都无法移开视线吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
